---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Insights & News - DecAltra"
  description="Perspectives on credit decision infrastructure, research, and updates from DecAltra."
>
  <div class="insights-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="kicker">Updates from DecAltra</div>
        <h1 id="page-title">Insights &amp; News</h1>
      </section>
      <section aria-label="Insights and news" class="perspective-grid">
        <article class="perspective-tile">
          <div class="tile-top">
            <span class="tag">Lending economics</span><span
              >Perspective</span
            >
          </div>
          <h2>
            <a class="perspective-link" href="/insights-news/is-the-cost-of-providing-credit-holding-back-europes-productivity">
              Is the cost of providing credit holding back Europe&rsquo;s
              productivity?
            </a>
          </h2>
          <p class="tile-deck">
            Suitable finance needs to reach viable businesses at the right time,
            through lending processes that are rigorous and economically
            sustainable.
          </p>

          <figure class="research-quote card-quote">
            <blockquote>
              &ldquo;Taking steps to lower delivery and monitoring costs would
              be instrumental in improving the economics of SME lending.&rdquo;
            </blockquote>
            <figcaption>
              <a
                href="https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/bank-insights/2026/what-drives-differences-in-commercial-banks-product-level-returns"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >Manning et al. · Bank of England · 2026 ↗</a
              >
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="takeaways">
            <h3>Main takeaways</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Financing constraints can hold back business investment and
                growth.
              </li>
              <li>
                Assessment and monitoring costs can make smaller loans less
                attractive to lenders.
              </li>
              <li>
                Better decision infrastructure can make rigorous lending more
                efficient and scalable.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tile-sources">
            <h3>Selected research informing our perspective</h3>
            <a
              href="https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/financial-stability-publications/fsr/special/html/ecb.fsrart202411_02~4161cc6124.en.html"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >ECB · Finance and productivity · 2024 ↗</a
            ><a
              href="https://www.bankofengland.co.uk/bank-insights/2026/what-drives-differences-in-commercial-banks-product-level-returns"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >Bank of England · Lending economics · 2026 ↗</a
            ><a
              href="https://www.oecd.org/en/publications/digitalisation-of-financial-services-access-to-finance-and-aggregate-economic-performance_10c7e583-en.html"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >OECD · Digitalisation and productivity · 2024 ↗</a
            >
          </div>
          <div class="tile-bottom">
            <a class="note-button" href="/insights-news/is-the-cost-of-providing-credit-holding-back-europes-productivity">
              Read perspective ↗</a
            ><span>DecAltra perspective</span>
          </div>
        </article>


      </section>
      <section class="manifesto">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">From perspective to practice</div>
          <h2>Better decisions start<br />with better foundations.</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>
            DecAltra connects information, analysis, and professional judgement.
            Our ambition is to help financial institutions spend less time
            preparing a case and more time understanding the opportunity in
            front of them.
          </p>
          <a class="textlink" href="/credit-decisioning"
            >Explore Credit Decisioning <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
          >
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>


<style>
  .insights-page {
    --ink: #17201d;
    --muted: #626f69;
    --line: #d8e0db;
    --green: #496d58;
    --display: 'Mona Sans', sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    font:
      15px/1.65 Inter,
      sans-serif;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  button {
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  a:focus-visible,
  button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #629478;
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }
  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .wrap {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }
  .intro {
    padding: 57px 0 39px;
  }
  .kicker {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 28px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-mist-700);
  }
  .kicker::before {
    content: '';
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 60px);
    margin: 17px 0 20px;
  }
  .perspective-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 26px;
    margin-top: 44px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .perspective-tile {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: subgrid;
    grid-row: span 7;
    row-gap: 0;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 34px;
    transition:
      box-shadow 0.2s,
      border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .perspective-tile:hover {
    border-color: #9aad9b;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px #243a2e0b;
  }
  .tile-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--color-mist-700);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .tag {
    color: #52725d;
    background: #edf3ed;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .perspective-tile h2 {
    font-size: 34px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 26px 0 18px;
  }
  .perspective-tile h2 .perspective-link {
    text-align: left;
    font: inherit;
    letter-spacing: inherit;
    color: inherit;
    padding: 0;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
  }
  .perspective-tile h2 .perspective-link::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }
  .tile-deck {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .research-quote {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #203d30;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 9px;
  }
  .research-quote blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    font: 500 21px/1.4 var(--display);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .research-quote figcaption {
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #d6e1d6;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .research-quote a {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .card-quote {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 210px;
  }
  .takeaways {
    background: #f1f5ef;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 22px;
    margin: 10px 0 28px;
  }
  .perspective-tile h3 {
    font:
      600 11px/1.5 Inter,
      sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .takeaways ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    list-style: disc;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #40574a;
  }
  .takeaways li + li {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .tile-sources {
    padding-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .tile-sources a {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 8px 0;
    color: #486652;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .tile-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .note-button {
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 550;
  }
  .note-button:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .tile-bottom .note-button {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .tile-bottom > span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 10px;
  }
  .manifesto {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 60px;
    padding: 43px 0;
    margin: 62px 0 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .manifesto h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    margin-top: 13px;
  }
  .manifesto p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .manifesto a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: #171b1d;
  }
  .manifesto a span {
    margin-left: 6px;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: #0a7e7d;
  }
  .textlink:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  dialog {
    margin: auto;
    width: min(780px, calc(100% - 32px));
    max-height: 88vh;
    overflow: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 17px;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: #fafbf9;
  }
  dialog::backdrop {
    background: #10201899;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }
  .dialog-bar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: #fafbf9;
    padding: 18px 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .dialog-bar span {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
  }
  .close {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: white;
    width: 35px;
    height: 35px;
    font-size: 21px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .article {
    padding: 34px 45px 44px;
  }
  .article h2 {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 23px;
  }
  .article h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin: 28px 0 12px;
  }
  .article p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: #5d6d62;
    margin: 0 0 15px;
  }
  .article a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .article blockquote {
    margin: 25px 0;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-left: 3px solid #a6bca2;
    background: #edf2e9;
    font: 500 24px/1.5 var(--display);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #37513c;
  }
  .article .research-quote blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .article ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 22px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .references {
    list-style: decimal;
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .references li + li {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .editorial-note {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
  .article .small {
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .wrap {
      padding: 0 24px;
    }
    .perspective-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .perspective-tile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      grid-row: auto;
      padding: 26px;
    }
    .perspective-tile h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
    .tile-top {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .card-quote {
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .manifesto {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .article {
      padding: 26px;
    }
    .article h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>
